52
00:07:19,459 --> 00:07:21,331
[Host] It means average age.

53
00:07:21,932 --> 00:07:32,923
[Slow] 広島市は、被爆の体験と平和への願いを、次の世代に伝え続けたいとしています。

54
00:07:33,723 --> 00:07:40,564
[Host] The city says it wants to keep passing on the survivors' experiences and the wish for peace to the next generation.

55
00:07:41,163 --> 00:07:43,324
